WEBVTT

00:06.882 --> 00:09.218
[ominous music playing]

00:55.681 --> 00:57.683
[thunder crashes]

01:04.440 --> 01:07.443
[music intensifies]

01:17.703 --> 01:19.163
Come on. Let's go.

01:32.551 --> 01:34.303
-[store bell rings]
-[girl 1] Wow.

01:35.012 --> 01:36.096
Can I have it?

01:38.891 --> 01:39.725
No.

01:40.434 --> 01:41.560
That's too expensive.

01:41.685 --> 01:43.312
We have to save
till we get to New York.

01:44.605 --> 01:46.273
You really think
we're gonna make it?

01:47.066 --> 01:48.317
[girl 2] Yeah, we're gonna make it.

01:49.276 --> 01:51.737
What if he finds us, beats us again,

01:51.862 --> 01:53.447
and locks us in the basement?

01:53.572 --> 01:54.949
Hey, Butthead.

01:55.032 --> 01:56.283
It will be worse than last time.

01:56.909 --> 01:57.868
Hey.

01:59.328 --> 02:00.996
That life is over now, okay?

02:01.080 --> 02:01.914
You're safe.

02:07.169 --> 02:08.629
Hey, look at this.

02:10.714 --> 02:11.924
You got a tattoo?

02:12.049 --> 02:13.634
Yeah, it's cool, right?

02:14.093 --> 02:16.053
No one's gonna cage us ever again.

02:17.638 --> 02:18.764
I promise.

02:22.893 --> 02:24.478
All right, come on. Let's go.

02:35.322 --> 02:36.490
[doorbell rings]

02:36.615 --> 02:37.825
[dramatic musical sting]

02:39.827 --> 02:41.495
[panting] It's him. It's him. It's him.

02:45.666 --> 02:48.210
[man] Saw two girls come in here.
Where the fuck are they?

02:48.752 --> 02:49.920
[manager] In the back.

02:52.339 --> 02:53.382
[mouths] Quiet.

02:55.843 --> 02:56.969
[man] Girls,

02:58.220 --> 02:59.388
come on out.

03:00.556 --> 03:02.683
I promise I'm not mad.

03:03.142 --> 03:05.561
I know things have been hard
since Mom died,

03:08.105 --> 03:11.275
but we're a family.
We gotta stick together, right?

03:15.696 --> 03:17.072
[grunts softly]

03:22.286 --> 03:23.996
-[alarm beeping]
-[gasps]

03:25.831 --> 03:27.666
-Hey!
-Go, go!

03:27.750 --> 03:29.001
-[man] Hey!
-I'm calling the cops!

03:31.128 --> 03:32.296
[man] Stop!

03:32.421 --> 03:34.131
[girls panting]

03:37.426 --> 03:38.427
[man] Come here.

03:39.303 --> 03:40.304
Cut them off!

03:40.429 --> 03:41.722
-[girl 1 screams]
-[tires squeal]

03:41.847 --> 03:43.557
[suspenseful music playing]

03:48.312 --> 03:50.022
[girl 2 panting]

03:50.105 --> 03:52.858
[man] You stupid little bitch.

03:54.318 --> 03:56.403
What you gonna do,
shoot your own father?

03:56.987 --> 03:58.739
[girl 2] You'll never touch her again.

03:59.323 --> 04:01.033
I can't let you take her.

04:01.158 --> 04:02.868
Get the fuck back.

04:04.203 --> 04:05.412
[yells]

04:05.496 --> 04:07.039
[father grunts]

04:07.498 --> 04:08.499
[gasps]

04:12.086 --> 04:13.337
[intriguing music playing]

04:17.925 --> 04:19.218
[sobs]

04:22.054 --> 04:23.639
[siren approaching]

04:42.950 --> 04:44.743
[inaudible speech]

04:50.624 --> 04:52.626
[sirens approaching]

04:56.672 --> 04:58.257
[thunder rumbling]

05:13.063 --> 05:15.441
[rain pattering]

05:22.698 --> 05:24.575
[man on radio] ...reconsider
any non-essential travel.

05:24.700 --> 05:27.077
There is a severe weather
warning coming through.

05:27.161 --> 05:28.746
It is not safe out there.

05:58.317 --> 05:59.318
May I help you?

06:00.069 --> 06:01.445
Hi.

06:01.570 --> 06:03.572
I'm Isabelle Davison, the new maid.

06:04.198 --> 06:06.283
I spoke with the superintendent
a few days ago.

06:06.867 --> 06:09.036
That'd be me. Lily Woodhouse.

06:09.161 --> 06:11.455
It's a pleasure to meet you
in the flesh, Isabelle.

06:12.498 --> 06:13.499
Do you have any ID?

06:14.083 --> 06:16.085
Yeah. Of course.

06:24.760 --> 06:25.886
You sound different.

06:26.720 --> 06:28.180
I'm getting over a cold.

06:30.224 --> 06:31.225
Hmm.

06:35.187 --> 06:37.106
[thunder rumbling]

06:43.487 --> 06:45.656
[music playing]

06:49.535 --> 06:51.120
[singer] ♪ Oh, I'm... ♪

06:51.203 --> 06:52.663
[buzzes]

06:57.376 --> 06:59.753
♪ ...so lonely, lonely for you ♪

07:00.504 --> 07:01.421
That's a lot of locks.

07:02.840 --> 07:04.925
Mementos from olden times.

07:07.761 --> 07:10.681
The Virgil was built in 1923.

07:10.764 --> 07:12.850
The neighborhood was different then,

07:12.975 --> 07:15.185
full of criminals and vagrants.

07:15.269 --> 07:17.187
People vanished in broad daylight.

07:17.271 --> 07:18.397
No one cared.

07:20.065 --> 07:21.817
Then came gentrification.

07:21.942 --> 07:22.818
[woman chuckles in distance]

07:22.943 --> 07:25.904
Now it's all coffee shops
and hipster bars.

07:25.988 --> 07:27.072
[distant laughter]

07:27.156 --> 07:29.575
Today, the Virgil is one
of the most exclusive buildings

07:29.700 --> 07:30.701
in Manhattan.

07:31.285 --> 07:34.663
I must ask you to surrender your phone
while you're on the premises.

07:35.164 --> 07:36.206
[girl] Seriously?

07:36.290 --> 07:39.001
[Lily] Our residents require
absolute privacy.

07:39.084 --> 07:40.169
[woman] Is this her?

07:41.420 --> 07:43.505
[Lily] Isabelle, our new maid.

07:43.589 --> 07:45.757
Allow me to introduce Miss Sharon,

07:45.841 --> 07:50.012
owner of Eternus, the fastest-growing
anti-aging cosmetics.

07:50.095 --> 07:52.931
Dr. Sheapman and his wife Anne,
our favorite residents.

07:53.015 --> 07:55.100
Oh, my goodness. You are soaking wet.

07:55.184 --> 07:56.560
You must be freezing.

07:56.685 --> 07:58.020
We need you strong.

07:58.103 --> 08:00.939
Oh, I... That's really not necessary.

08:01.023 --> 08:02.316
Nonsense. It looks great on you.

08:02.441 --> 08:04.026
Just give it back to me later.

08:05.861 --> 08:07.279
What happened to your eye?

08:08.739 --> 08:09.907
Fell in the shower.

08:10.699 --> 08:12.743
There's no shame in admitting
you're in trouble.

08:12.826 --> 08:14.369
This is a safe space.

08:14.453 --> 08:17.748
They say the eyes
are the windows to the soul.

08:18.332 --> 08:19.666
Yours must be sad.

08:19.750 --> 08:21.627
[chuckles] You'll have
to excuse my wife.

08:21.710 --> 08:22.586
She's a writer.

08:31.094 --> 08:33.639
[Lily] The first floor
is reserved for service staff.

08:34.348 --> 08:35.766
[girl] How long have
you been working here?

08:35.849 --> 08:38.435
[Lily scoffs] Seems like an eternity.

08:38.518 --> 08:39.811
Ladies.

08:40.729 --> 08:42.105
Oh, give me a moment.

08:43.649 --> 08:45.025
[woman laughs softly]

08:45.108 --> 08:46.401
[indistinct chatter]

08:46.485 --> 08:47.611
[woman] Oh, it's... it's a...

08:48.654 --> 08:50.656
-Okay.
-I have a new offering.

08:53.075 --> 08:54.326
[Lily chuckles]

08:54.409 --> 08:55.494
Hmm?

08:56.203 --> 08:57.204
[boy belches]

08:57.955 --> 08:59.122
Hi, Piggy.

09:00.249 --> 09:01.500
Excuse me?

09:01.625 --> 09:04.795
That was not polite, Damian.

09:04.878 --> 09:05.796
[laughs]

09:08.674 --> 09:10.425
What are they celebrating?

09:11.051 --> 09:12.928
Oh, it's a small tradition.

09:13.553 --> 09:17.391
One of our maids will be rewarded
tonight for her dedication.

09:17.516 --> 09:19.226
These people came here with nothing.

09:20.060 --> 09:21.895
They were broken and lost.

09:21.979 --> 09:23.897
I gave them a place to belong.

09:23.981 --> 09:25.274
Ah, this is you.

09:26.817 --> 09:28.110
-[man grunts]
-[gasps]

09:28.694 --> 09:30.529
Ray, what are you doing in there?

09:31.822 --> 09:32.948
Picking up the trash.

09:33.532 --> 09:34.700
I believe I told you.

09:35.575 --> 09:38.120
Steer clear of the new arrivals.

09:38.245 --> 09:40.706
And I thought I told you
to leave me the fuck alone.

09:44.167 --> 09:46.003
Well, I'm afraid I can't do that.

09:47.004 --> 09:48.505
I'm still your boss.

09:48.588 --> 09:49.673
And your wife.

09:49.756 --> 09:51.258
[chuckles drily]

09:52.718 --> 09:54.261
-Love ya.
-Fuck off.

09:55.387 --> 09:56.346
[sighs]

09:56.430 --> 09:57.597
Sorry about that.

10:04.604 --> 10:07.316
My husband drinks too much
and says crazy things.

10:08.025 --> 10:10.027
Leaves stuff around
that frightens people.

10:13.405 --> 10:16.116
If you find anything unusual,
just ignore it.

10:16.199 --> 10:19.995
Tomorrow, I'll get you a key
and show you the rest of the building.

10:25.584 --> 10:26.752
Sweet dreams.

10:40.432 --> 10:42.184
[zipper slides]

11:11.963 --> 11:14.007
[ominous music playing]

11:43.370 --> 11:44.538
[exhales]

11:56.299 --> 11:57.300
[softly] God.

12:13.733 --> 12:14.985
[thudding]

12:35.213 --> 12:36.465
[cigarette lighter clicks]

12:45.348 --> 12:46.725
-[heavy thud]
-[gasps]

12:48.477 --> 12:49.853
[groans] Oh, shit.

12:49.936 --> 12:51.771
[grunts]

12:56.193 --> 12:57.903
[woman laughing]

12:59.529 --> 13:01.114
[door opens]

13:08.371 --> 13:09.956
[clanking]

13:10.123 --> 13:11.082
Shit.

13:20.383 --> 13:21.676
-[heavy clank]
-[gasps]

13:31.686 --> 13:32.812
Hello?

13:36.691 --> 13:37.734
[door slams]

13:45.659 --> 13:46.660
[exhales]

13:50.580 --> 13:51.581
[clicks]

13:56.002 --> 13:57.295
[cigarette lighter clicks
repeatedly]

14:02.008 --> 14:03.885
[ominous music playing]

14:11.851 --> 14:12.852
[music building]

14:50.181 --> 14:51.224
[lock clicking]

14:55.020 --> 14:56.104
[lock rattles]

15:03.361 --> 15:05.113
[snores softly]

15:19.085 --> 15:21.046
[ominous music playing]

15:30.347 --> 15:32.390
[music intensifies]

15:56.748 --> 15:57.999
[glass clinking]

16:08.468 --> 16:10.261
[dramatic musical sting]

16:14.599 --> 16:15.850
[rasping breathing]

16:19.187 --> 16:21.022
[breathes heavily]

16:29.739 --> 16:30.782
[softly] Mm.

16:34.619 --> 16:36.621
[rasping breath]

16:39.207 --> 16:41.501
[figure grunts wheezily]

16:54.347 --> 16:56.182
[gasps, pants]

17:11.072 --> 17:13.032
[ominous music playing]

17:13.116 --> 17:14.909
[bed creaking]

17:23.668 --> 17:25.295
[breathes shallowly]

17:25.378 --> 17:27.672
[both grunting]

17:37.807 --> 17:39.267
-[grunts]
-[girl gasps]

17:47.275 --> 17:48.943
[moans softly]

17:50.737 --> 17:52.238
-[thudding]
-[gasps]

17:55.700 --> 17:56.868
[thudding continues]

18:03.833 --> 18:04.834
[grunts]

18:06.085 --> 18:07.128
[grunts]

18:09.130 --> 18:10.715
-[thudding continues]
-[grunts]

18:15.094 --> 18:16.179
[grunts, pants]

18:28.191 --> 18:29.734
[suspenseful music playing]

18:33.988 --> 18:35.031
[grunts]

18:41.496 --> 18:43.289
[hissing]

18:58.638 --> 18:59.639
[man] She's out.

19:05.645 --> 19:06.604
He's out too.

19:08.773 --> 19:09.774
Why didn't he wait for us?

19:10.483 --> 19:11.734
I'm telling you, he fucks them.

19:11.818 --> 19:13.236
Fucking pervert.

19:13.361 --> 19:14.362
[Sharon] I know.

19:14.737 --> 19:16.656
[objects clattering]

19:23.496 --> 19:24.330
[man] Chaps.

19:24.414 --> 19:25.540
[Sharon] My jacket.

19:26.416 --> 19:27.959
Oh, there's a stain.

19:28.501 --> 19:29.669
[man 2] What happened?

19:29.794 --> 19:31.212
[Sharon] This bitch knocked out Bob.

19:36.509 --> 19:37.510
[groans softly]

19:40.138 --> 19:41.973
What the... Oh!

19:43.224 --> 19:44.601
[screams]

19:44.684 --> 19:46.561
Motherfucking shit!

19:49.105 --> 19:51.441
[yells]

19:55.820 --> 19:56.946
What the fuck was that?

19:57.405 --> 19:58.740
[whimpering]

20:02.535 --> 20:04.370
Isabelle, what are you doing?

20:05.872 --> 20:08.625
This is ridiculous. Just come out.

20:08.708 --> 20:10.627
[girl] Fuck you,
you fucking cocksuckers!

20:10.710 --> 20:11.711
Hmm.

20:13.087 --> 20:15.006
-[clattering]
-[grunts]

20:15.673 --> 20:17.216
Oh, for crying out loud.

20:17.300 --> 20:19.135
Come on, guys. It's just one girl.

20:20.094 --> 20:21.304
Tell that to Bob.

20:21.387 --> 20:23.723
[Bob gasps, shudders]

20:25.308 --> 20:26.309
[grunts]

20:34.150 --> 20:36.319
[suspenseful music playing]

20:45.870 --> 20:47.038
[chuckles]

20:48.623 --> 20:49.874
[man] Gotcha.

20:50.750 --> 20:52.752
-[blade swishes]
-[Sharon gasps]

21:00.510 --> 21:01.803
[creaking]

21:03.221 --> 21:05.223
[up-tempo organ music playing]

21:14.482 --> 21:16.317
-[heavy thud]
-[blade whooshes]

21:20.071 --> 21:21.072
[Sharon gasps]

21:25.368 --> 21:26.244
[yells]

21:28.663 --> 21:30.373
[all grunting]

21:30.498 --> 21:31.541
[Sharon yells]

21:32.625 --> 21:34.627
[all grunting]

21:39.966 --> 21:40.800
[Sharon screams]

21:48.933 --> 21:49.976
[groans]

21:52.770 --> 21:53.771
[gasps]

21:55.064 --> 21:56.107
[blood splashing]

21:57.692 --> 21:59.152
[agonized groan]

22:02.989 --> 22:04.407
[both grunting]

22:23.301 --> 22:24.302
[girl yells]

22:26.012 --> 22:27.013
[panting]

22:29.724 --> 22:30.850
[grunts]

22:35.313 --> 22:36.856
-[blade thuds]
-[grunts]

22:36.981 --> 22:39.442
[agonized yell]

22:41.027 --> 22:42.445
[yells]

22:43.029 --> 22:44.072
[screams]

22:47.200 --> 22:49.077
[breathes heavily]

22:51.454 --> 22:52.580
[gun clicks]

22:56.793 --> 22:58.711
[breath trembling]

23:00.588 --> 23:01.631
[grunts]

23:03.299 --> 23:05.301
[upbeat rap music playing]

23:13.893 --> 23:16.521
Who are you?

23:19.482 --> 23:20.483
[gun clicks]

23:22.902 --> 23:23.820
[Sharon grunts]

23:24.904 --> 23:25.905
[cries out]

23:39.418 --> 23:40.419
[knife whooshing]

23:41.838 --> 23:43.339
[screams]

23:44.799 --> 23:46.968
[screaming, yelling]

23:47.510 --> 23:49.387
[shouts unintelligibly]

23:51.097 --> 23:53.057
I can't understand what you're saying.

23:54.142 --> 23:55.685
[yells]

23:56.978 --> 23:58.271
[Bob grunts]

24:03.526 --> 24:04.861
[exhales]

24:08.823 --> 24:10.825
[dramatic music playing]

24:18.541 --> 24:19.375
[girl grunts]

24:31.554 --> 24:32.763
[hand clap]

24:36.142 --> 24:37.727
That was unexpected.

24:39.729 --> 24:40.897
[blade whooshes]

24:43.149 --> 24:45.735
Something tells me you weren't
entirely honest with me.

24:46.861 --> 24:48.154
Well, neither were you.

24:49.864 --> 24:51.157
I guess we're both liars.

24:52.158 --> 24:55.161
I have... questions.

24:55.286 --> 24:56.996
Answer mine first.

25:01.000 --> 25:02.293
Who...

25:03.502 --> 25:05.046
the fuck...

25:06.047 --> 25:07.340
are you?

25:07.423 --> 25:08.883
[dramatic musical sting]

25:09.008 --> 25:11.010
[gentle music playing]

25:23.940 --> 25:25.942
[Asia panting]

25:27.860 --> 25:31.239
[Asia] Ten years ago,
I made the biggest mistake of my life.

25:32.782 --> 25:36.911
I should have protected my sister,
but I panicked, and I ran.

25:38.537 --> 25:40.498
It was the last time I saw her.

25:42.083 --> 25:43.876
That fucker survived.

25:43.960 --> 25:46.128
Maria got put back in his custody.

25:49.382 --> 25:51.634
I got caught, eventually.

25:52.510 --> 25:53.511
You okay?

25:53.636 --> 25:55.346
Now it's time to make things right.

25:56.931 --> 25:57.932
[Asia grunts]

25:59.767 --> 26:01.102
Get her.

26:01.978 --> 26:03.980
[inmates shouting in distance]

26:05.731 --> 26:06.983
[buzzer sounds]

26:07.066 --> 26:09.402
[private investigator] Yeah,
I've heard this 1,000 times.

26:10.403 --> 26:13.114
You got a parole hearing coming up.
You should lay low.

26:13.239 --> 26:14.115
[Asia scoffs]

26:14.949 --> 26:16.575
Did I hire you for advice?

26:17.243 --> 26:18.744
[private investigator sighs]

26:20.454 --> 26:23.457
Last known photo, Maria Reaves.

26:24.166 --> 26:28.004
Taken at a New Jersey motel
before she disappeared.

26:32.383 --> 26:35.011
I tracked her phone
to the last place it worked.

26:35.094 --> 26:38.139
An exclusive co-op building,
uptown Manhattan.

26:39.557 --> 26:40.474
Virgil.

26:46.439 --> 26:48.316
Virgil's got a sketchy rep.

26:48.441 --> 26:50.443
Some folks they hire go missing.

26:51.444 --> 26:55.865
Mostly minorities, illegals,
people off the street.

26:55.990 --> 26:57.867
So what are you saying? She, um...

26:57.992 --> 26:59.618
Your sister is in trouble.

27:00.703 --> 27:04.498
Cops won't look too hard,
especially with the rich involved.

27:06.000 --> 27:07.376
Get this.

27:07.460 --> 27:10.171
I talked to some cleaning ladies
that knew Maria.

27:10.755 --> 27:14.800
A few days ago, one of them got a call
from that building manager, Lily.

27:14.884 --> 27:17.636
She offered her a gig as a maid.

27:18.346 --> 27:19.347
No shit.

27:20.890 --> 27:22.475
She starts next month.

27:24.060 --> 27:25.269
What's her name?

27:25.353 --> 27:26.479
[doorbell rings]

27:31.817 --> 27:33.069
Isabelle Davison?

27:33.778 --> 27:34.820
Yes?

27:38.741 --> 27:40.201
My name...

27:41.369 --> 27:42.536
is Asia Reaves.

27:44.538 --> 27:47.083
And I have come for my sister Maria.

27:51.212 --> 27:55.508
Now, I don't know what the fuck
is going on in here.

27:56.675 --> 27:57.676
But I know one thing.

28:00.805 --> 28:04.100
If she's alive, give her to me,

28:05.393 --> 28:09.105
and pray I am in a forgiving mood.

28:09.730 --> 28:11.107
'Cause if she's dead...

28:11.232 --> 28:12.400
You're an avenger.

28:13.818 --> 28:15.653
[sighs] That explains a lot.

28:18.572 --> 28:23.452
You must love your sister very much
to risk your life for her.

28:24.829 --> 28:25.996
Where is she?

28:27.289 --> 28:28.416
I'd like to help you.

28:29.959 --> 28:32.128
But I too have a family to care for.

28:33.129 --> 28:37.299
A rather unusual family
with rather unusual needs.

28:38.884 --> 28:40.553
[dramatic music playing]

29:36.317 --> 29:38.110
[flesh crackling]

29:52.333 --> 29:53.626
Just a flesh wound.

29:56.670 --> 29:57.671
[Lily] Get the blade!

29:58.672 --> 30:00.216
[Asia panting]

30:00.341 --> 30:01.383
Oh, my...

30:02.134 --> 30:03.969
I got her, Mrs. Lily! I got her!

30:04.053 --> 30:05.679
[both grunting]

30:05.763 --> 30:08.307
[man] Oh, Asia, come on.

30:08.390 --> 30:09.391
Stop it!

30:09.517 --> 30:10.809
[Asia and maid grunt]

30:11.268 --> 30:13.729
[man] Killing us won't help you.

30:13.812 --> 30:15.189
Just give up.

30:15.272 --> 30:16.815
[Sharon] Yeah, give up.

30:17.566 --> 30:19.068
[whimpers]

30:19.860 --> 30:22.446
What have you done to my mom, you bitch?

30:22.530 --> 30:23.531
Shut up!

30:26.408 --> 30:27.409
I killed all of you...

30:28.285 --> 30:29.537
Fucking broad!

30:29.662 --> 30:31.747
[Asia yells]

30:31.830 --> 30:33.290
You little shit!

30:33.415 --> 30:35.584
[yells, pants]

30:40.297 --> 30:41.423
-Get up!
-[Bob grunts]

30:42.007 --> 30:43.175
[maid groans]

30:45.594 --> 30:48.556
Sophia, dear, when you resurrect,

30:48.681 --> 30:50.766
please remember to clean up the blood.

30:51.559 --> 30:54.311
Yes, Mrs. Lily.

30:54.436 --> 30:55.604
[exhales]

31:00.317 --> 31:01.318
-[flesh squishes]
-[Lily grunts]

31:04.488 --> 31:05.906
What the fuck is going on?

31:10.286 --> 31:11.787
[screams]

31:17.459 --> 31:18.752
[yelling]

31:22.631 --> 31:25.634
[Lily] Asia, the building's locked down.
You can't escape.

31:25.718 --> 31:29.722
-[Asia yells]
-Be reasonable. Open the door.

31:30.514 --> 31:31.682
Fuck you.

31:31.765 --> 31:33.434
[Lily] Have it your way.

31:35.185 --> 31:36.520
You're not the first.

31:36.645 --> 31:38.188
You won't be the last.

31:38.314 --> 31:40.065
Nobody gets out of here alive.

31:40.232 --> 31:42.026
[Asia strains, grunts]

31:46.905 --> 31:48.324
What the fucking...

31:48.407 --> 31:50.117
[grunting]

31:51.535 --> 31:53.912
[Lily] Steve,
break this goddamn door open.

31:57.041 --> 31:59.543
No! No!

32:01.337 --> 32:02.838
Come on.

32:05.966 --> 32:07.551
[strains]

32:16.352 --> 32:17.436
[panting]

32:18.270 --> 32:19.271
Yes!

32:26.528 --> 32:27.863
[strains]

32:31.575 --> 32:32.868
[pounding at door]

32:42.419 --> 32:43.837
[ominous note plays]

32:53.305 --> 32:54.431
-[heavy thud]
-[gasps]

32:56.600 --> 32:58.310
[eerie music playing]

33:00.979 --> 33:02.606
[panting]

33:18.455 --> 33:19.498
[Asia grunts softly]

33:23.752 --> 33:25.754
[grunts, pants]

33:54.616 --> 33:55.659
[man] We should tell the others.

33:55.743 --> 33:57.035
[Lily] No one needs to know.

33:57.119 --> 33:59.496
It happens quickly and quietly
before tonight's ceremony.

34:00.497 --> 34:01.749
[man] You think we can hide this?

34:02.249 --> 34:04.835
Your job is to find someone
nice and helpless.

34:04.960 --> 34:06.253
Does anything
about that vicious bitch

34:06.378 --> 34:08.046
seem nice or helpless to you?

34:08.130 --> 34:10.674
[Lily] Kevin, darling,
how is it possible that five of you

34:10.799 --> 34:12.009
couldn't capture one girl?

34:12.092 --> 34:13.218
[Kevin] She was armed!

34:13.385 --> 34:15.971
-[Lily] And you're immortal!
-[Sharon] It still hurts!

34:16.054 --> 34:17.055
[Lily] Pull it together.

34:17.639 --> 34:19.600
We owe an offering tonight.

34:19.683 --> 34:21.059
We have to find her.

34:21.977 --> 34:23.103
[Kevin] What about her sister?

34:23.228 --> 34:24.396
-[book thuds]
-[Lily] Shh.

34:25.105 --> 34:26.273
Did you hear that?

34:26.982 --> 34:28.192
[Kevin] Hear what? No.

34:28.275 --> 34:29.276
Didn't hear anything.

34:29.401 --> 34:30.736
[scraping]

34:32.404 --> 34:34.114
-Ah.
-[exhales]

34:35.115 --> 34:36.992
[strains, grunts]

34:37.534 --> 34:38.702
[Lily] Get her!

34:39.953 --> 34:42.122
-[pounding on door]
-[grunts]

34:46.293 --> 34:47.294
[Lily] Don't kill her!

34:47.419 --> 34:48.670
[Kevin] I'll just cut her up a bit.

34:49.254 --> 34:50.547
[Kevin grunting]

34:56.261 --> 34:57.304
[Asia grunts]

34:58.263 --> 35:00.265
[cries out, whimpers]

35:01.141 --> 35:02.017
[Kevin] Gotcha.

35:04.436 --> 35:05.395
I warned you.

35:05.479 --> 35:08.023
Running is pointless.
You could have avoided the pain.

35:10.859 --> 35:12.820
-[strains]
-[flesh rips]

35:12.903 --> 35:14.863
[cries in pain]

35:16.156 --> 35:17.157
[panting]

35:17.908 --> 35:19.201
Eat shit!

35:20.035 --> 35:21.161
[Sharon grunts]

35:22.037 --> 35:23.163
What the fuck are you doing?

35:23.288 --> 35:24.498
We need her alive!

35:25.791 --> 35:26.792
[Asia panting]

35:26.875 --> 35:28.627
[dramatic music playing]

35:37.511 --> 35:38.637
[breathes heavily]

35:54.903 --> 35:56.071
[Sharon laughs]

35:57.030 --> 35:59.074
I'm gonna tear you apart, bitch!

36:02.828 --> 36:04.079
Are you ready to die?

36:05.122 --> 36:06.206
Leave me alone, bitch!

36:06.331 --> 36:08.083
[grunts, pants]

36:11.503 --> 36:12.880
[Sharon laughs]

36:12.963 --> 36:14.339
Wrong way!

36:16.508 --> 36:17.426
[Sharon grunts]

36:17.509 --> 36:18.510
[cries out]

36:22.973 --> 36:24.266
[Sharon yells in agony]

36:26.226 --> 36:27.978
[blade thuds repeatedly]

36:28.687 --> 36:30.397
[Asia] Fucking die!

36:34.568 --> 36:36.403
[breathes heavily]

36:42.743 --> 36:44.244
[panting]

36:46.288 --> 36:47.456
[grunts]

36:50.751 --> 36:52.252
[grunts]

36:55.547 --> 36:56.715
[shudders]

37:02.846 --> 37:04.556
[grunts]

37:07.851 --> 37:09.853
-[cries out]
-[Sharon grunts]

37:13.065 --> 37:15.150
[groans] Oh, I'm sick of you killing me!

37:18.320 --> 37:19.321
[growls]

37:19.446 --> 37:20.489
[gasps]

37:21.156 --> 37:22.783
And stay dead, bitch!

37:24.618 --> 37:26.620
[coughs, gasps]

37:32.459 --> 37:33.752
[breathing rapidly]

37:38.757 --> 37:40.300
[shudders]

37:50.644 --> 37:52.396
-[dramatic musical sting]
-[gasps]

37:55.357 --> 37:57.192
[Asia screams, whimpers]

37:58.944 --> 38:00.153
Get away from me!

38:00.237 --> 38:02.072
What the hell? Oh, my God!

38:05.492 --> 38:07.244
[whimpers]

38:07.369 --> 38:09.121
[suspenseful music playing]

38:26.680 --> 38:28.098
[panting]

38:30.851 --> 38:32.602
[exhales]

38:32.686 --> 38:34.396
[muffled gasp]

38:55.417 --> 38:57.044
[Ray] You didn't get my message.

38:57.127 --> 38:58.003
[Asia] What message?

38:58.086 --> 38:59.463
[Ray] On the fucking mirror.

39:07.304 --> 39:08.555
What the fuck is going on here?

39:09.681 --> 39:12.726
The shit you're in is deeper
than you can imagine.

39:18.315 --> 39:21.193
[Ray] This building
is a temple for Satan.

39:22.027 --> 39:24.029
It's been around for 100 years,

39:24.863 --> 39:27.491
but the family's roots
go back much further.

39:28.909 --> 39:31.078
Our founders discovered
a way to communicate

39:31.161 --> 39:34.498
with the other side
through a sacred conduit.

39:36.166 --> 39:37.834
They made a deal.

39:37.918 --> 39:39.669
Immortality.

39:39.753 --> 39:42.339
In exchange for human sacrifices.

39:42.923 --> 39:45.425
As long as your name is on the list,

39:45.509 --> 39:47.010
you cannot die.

39:48.303 --> 39:50.639
Most of the members are rich assholes

39:50.722 --> 39:53.183
with the power to protect
Virgil's secrets.

39:53.308 --> 39:55.519
They lure in poor bastards like you...

39:56.103 --> 39:58.980
Virgil was built in 1923.

39:59.064 --> 40:01.066
[Ray] ...just to turn them
into offerings.

40:01.775 --> 40:02.776
But once in a while,

40:02.901 --> 40:06.780
the chosen few are spared
and given the chance to join the family.

40:06.905 --> 40:08.532
I'm so glad we didn't kill you.

40:08.657 --> 40:10.617
It is so hard to find good help.

40:11.201 --> 40:13.954
[Ray] Bust your ass,
and you might climb up the ladder.

40:15.831 --> 40:16.790
Like Lily.

40:17.916 --> 40:18.834
Fuck up,

40:18.959 --> 40:21.211
and your name will be erased
from the list,

40:21.920 --> 40:23.797
making you mortal again.

40:24.506 --> 40:25.799
[Asia] Fuck me!

40:25.924 --> 40:27.425
[Ray] Aptly put.

40:27.509 --> 40:29.386
Because tonight, you are the offering.

40:29.511 --> 40:30.971
[Asia grunting]

40:31.054 --> 40:32.389
Wait, wait!

40:34.766 --> 40:37.018
I blew this bitch's head off,
and she still came after me.

40:37.102 --> 40:38.353
How do you kill them?

40:38.436 --> 40:40.647
[Ray] Did you even listen to me?

40:40.730 --> 40:42.774
While they're on the list, you can't.

40:43.525 --> 40:45.360
You can only slow them down
for a few seconds,

40:45.443 --> 40:46.486
maybe a minute,

40:46.570 --> 40:47.737
depending on the damage.

40:47.821 --> 40:49.156
[Asia] But I blew her fucking head off!

40:49.281 --> 40:50.782
[Ray] She'll grow it back.

40:51.700 --> 40:53.118
They always come back.

40:54.077 --> 40:55.120
[mysterious music playing]

41:13.889 --> 41:14.890
[Ray grunts]

41:22.814 --> 41:25.317
[Asia] What if I chop them
into a thousand pieces

41:25.400 --> 41:26.735
and set them on fire?

41:26.860 --> 41:29.070
[Ray] Even if there's one piece left,

41:30.071 --> 41:33.867
even a slice of skin
will still keep living on its own.

41:35.035 --> 41:36.453
[both grunting]

41:52.344 --> 41:53.511
[grunts]

41:55.472 --> 41:57.349
[mysterious music playing]

42:12.030 --> 42:13.406
[distant moaning]

42:17.744 --> 42:19.037
[people moaning]

42:20.789 --> 42:22.374
What the hell is this place?

42:26.211 --> 42:27.504
Fuck floor.

42:28.505 --> 42:31.508
Immortality gets boring after a while.

42:31.633 --> 42:33.802
So each floor caters
to a different vice.

42:35.512 --> 42:37.389
If you're one of them,
why are you helping me?

42:39.975 --> 42:41.059
I have my reasons.

43:05.834 --> 43:06.835
[Ray grunts]

43:09.754 --> 43:10.880
Hold your fire.

43:11.006 --> 43:12.173
-[pounding on door]
-[woman] Let me out.

43:13.008 --> 43:14.718
Why did you lock me in here?

43:17.554 --> 43:18.596
[Asia] Maria?

43:40.744 --> 43:41.870
I thought you were dead.

43:42.746 --> 43:43.997
I thought you were in prison.

43:46.416 --> 43:47.792
What are you doing here?

43:49.627 --> 43:51.338
I came here to save you, Butthead.

43:52.630 --> 43:55.175
This whole building, it's, like...

43:55.925 --> 43:57.344
it's a satanic cult.

43:58.970 --> 44:00.638
They have human sacrifices.

44:03.224 --> 44:04.225
I know.

44:06.019 --> 44:07.103
You know?

44:08.938 --> 44:09.814
Yeah.

44:20.200 --> 44:21.785
Come on. Let's go.

44:21.910 --> 44:23.912
[mysterious music playing]

44:43.098 --> 44:44.516
[siren blaring]

44:46.976 --> 44:48.103
[man clears throat]

44:49.062 --> 44:50.021
I don't get it.

44:50.105 --> 44:51.147
I found you on the streets.

44:51.272 --> 44:53.233
I give you shelter and a good job.

44:53.817 --> 44:55.402
Why would you tell the other girls I am,

44:55.527 --> 44:58.696
and I quote, "a fucking asshole"?

44:59.864 --> 45:02.283
I'm very grateful for everything
you've done for me, Richie.

45:02.409 --> 45:04.035
No, no, you're not.

45:04.119 --> 45:05.120
I am.

45:11.709 --> 45:14.087
Here's the thing. I...
I want to believe you.

45:15.130 --> 45:16.881
But it's just words, y'know.

45:17.048 --> 45:18.174
And as we've just established,

45:18.299 --> 45:20.093
you can't really trust
what people are saying.

45:20.176 --> 45:25.682
Now, if you could do something
to prove you're grateful,

45:25.765 --> 45:28.435
well, maybe then I would believe you.

45:31.020 --> 45:32.147
[thunder rumbling]

45:41.281 --> 45:43.283
[dramatic music playing]

45:55.879 --> 45:56.921
[gasps]

46:11.769 --> 46:12.854
[exhales]

46:12.937 --> 46:16.483
It doesn't appear so,
but it's your lucky day.

46:18.401 --> 46:21.488
Ordinarily, we'd slit your throat
in the name of our Lord,

46:21.613 --> 46:26.201
but one of our maids
was just caught stealing.

46:27.076 --> 46:29.204
You could take her place.

46:29.329 --> 46:32.499
Finally stop struggling
and have a home where you belong.

46:33.416 --> 46:36.211
We'll take care of you. Understand?

46:39.047 --> 46:40.381
Splendid.

46:40.507 --> 46:41.841
[musical sting]

46:52.060 --> 46:53.520
This is my home now.

46:56.814 --> 46:59.400
I'm not going anywhere with you.

47:02.153 --> 47:04.822
Well, I'm not leaving without you.

47:05.990 --> 47:07.408
You already have.

47:11.287 --> 47:13.373
What? Do you think I need you?

47:15.166 --> 47:17.252
When I was a kid, I needed you.

47:19.003 --> 47:21.839
The night you abandoned me,
I needed you.

47:25.009 --> 47:26.094
While you were in prison

47:26.177 --> 47:30.014
and our piece-of-shit father was beating
the crap out of me, I really needed you.

47:32.016 --> 47:33.309
But you are too late now.

47:34.435 --> 47:35.562
I don't need you.

47:39.482 --> 47:40.608
Wow!

47:41.150 --> 47:42.068
Go ahead and run.

47:42.735 --> 47:44.445
Try not to get caught this time.

47:45.780 --> 47:46.864
[clears throat softly]

47:49.492 --> 47:52.912
Do you have any idea
what I went through to find you?

47:53.621 --> 47:54.998
I don't care.

47:55.498 --> 47:56.499
Fuck you.

47:56.624 --> 47:59.502
-No. Fuck you.
-No, bitch. Fuck you.

47:59.627 --> 48:00.878
Fuck you!

48:03.339 --> 48:05.425
[Asia exhales]

48:10.054 --> 48:12.098
Family reunions can be challenging.

48:12.724 --> 48:14.017
This changes nothing.

48:14.100 --> 48:16.060
She's coming with me
whether she wants to or not.

48:16.227 --> 48:18.730
You don't understand.
It's not that simple for her.

48:18.813 --> 48:19.772
[Asia] I don't care.

48:21.190 --> 48:22.650
How do you get out of here?

48:23.651 --> 48:26.112
This whole building
was designed to be a death trap.

48:26.195 --> 48:29.407
All the windows are shatterproof.
You've seen the locks on the front door.

48:29.490 --> 48:32.118
Now, there is one way out.

48:32.201 --> 48:33.870
It's a fire escape ladder off the roof.

48:33.953 --> 48:35.955
But you have to go through
the ninth floor,

48:36.080 --> 48:37.665
and that's the last place
you want to be.

48:38.541 --> 48:40.126
Oh, hell, I'll help you.

48:40.918 --> 48:42.086
I'm done with this shit.

48:43.212 --> 48:44.380
Mmm.

48:46.341 --> 48:47.342
[Asia grunts]

48:50.970 --> 48:53.681
You little son of a bitch!

48:55.558 --> 48:57.101
[panting]

48:59.937 --> 49:01.648
Hey! Have you seen her?

49:02.690 --> 49:03.691
Hey!

49:04.817 --> 49:05.985
Shit! Fuck!

49:06.069 --> 49:07.528
What happened to your head?

49:07.654 --> 49:11.783
What? I don't understand. You...

49:11.866 --> 49:13.284
What...

49:13.409 --> 49:14.827
Oh! Fuck floor!

49:15.828 --> 49:17.288
She's found her sister.

49:17.413 --> 49:18.456
[message alert beeps]

49:22.543 --> 49:23.544
You!

49:24.712 --> 49:26.130
[grunts]

49:26.839 --> 49:27.715
[elevator beeps]

49:30.885 --> 49:31.886
Come on!

49:32.011 --> 49:33.012
[Asia grunting]

49:36.599 --> 49:37.850
[BDSM Grandma] Wait! Holy...

49:38.976 --> 49:39.769
[screams]

49:39.852 --> 49:40.728
[BDSM Grandpa] Hey, get off!

49:47.568 --> 49:49.445
[Ray grunting]

49:53.866 --> 49:54.867
[yells]

49:55.410 --> 49:56.411
Fucking bitch!

49:57.328 --> 49:58.371
That is it.

49:58.454 --> 50:00.832
I'm done fucking around.
We need everyone.

50:00.915 --> 50:03.251
-Wait a minute.
-Not even a discussion.

50:03.334 --> 50:05.628
You fucking traitor.

50:05.753 --> 50:06.796
Go.

50:06.879 --> 50:08.297
[dramatic music playing]

50:12.927 --> 50:13.803
[bell dings]

50:26.816 --> 50:27.942
[strains]

50:38.244 --> 50:40.121
[footsteps approaching]

50:45.209 --> 50:46.669
[growls]

51:08.274 --> 51:09.275
[gun clicks]

51:15.239 --> 51:16.240
[Maria's muffled cry]

51:30.755 --> 51:32.548
[Asia's breath trembling]

51:38.137 --> 51:40.139
[suspenseful music playing]

51:43.142 --> 51:44.769
[grunts, groans]

51:48.022 --> 51:49.857
[whimpers]

51:52.860 --> 51:53.986
[cries out]

52:01.494 --> 52:02.912
[breathing heavily]

52:03.496 --> 52:04.622
[grunts]

52:15.925 --> 52:17.093
[groans]

52:22.181 --> 52:23.516
-[heavy thud]
-[gasps]

52:27.061 --> 52:28.312
[chokes]

52:36.654 --> 52:37.780
[heavy thud]

52:41.659 --> 52:42.827
[moans softly]

52:52.044 --> 52:54.380
[Lily] Just tell me one thing.

52:55.214 --> 52:56.382
Why?

52:58.926 --> 53:01.095
I'm tired of paying
the bill with blood, Lily.

53:02.680 --> 53:04.682
Didn't bother you for 100 years.

53:06.851 --> 53:09.687
Back in the day, when this
neighborhood was a shithole...

53:11.731 --> 53:16.277
I convinced myself that
we were making things better

53:16.402 --> 53:18.821
by taking the scum off the streets.

53:20.114 --> 53:21.407
But now...

53:23.743 --> 53:25.244
our victims are good people.

53:26.996 --> 53:28.748
There's nothing good about that girl.

53:28.831 --> 53:30.499
Oh, yeah? And what about
the previous one

53:30.583 --> 53:31.667
and the one before?

53:31.751 --> 53:33.294
There's nothing good about them, too?

53:35.588 --> 53:38.466
The world is not fair, Ray.

53:39.550 --> 53:41.010
I did not make it so.

53:42.261 --> 53:43.554
Shall I remind you

53:44.764 --> 53:48.893
what it was like for us
before we came to Virgil?

53:49.894 --> 53:50.895
I remember.

53:52.480 --> 53:53.731
We were all alone.

53:54.857 --> 53:56.484
We had each other.

53:57.151 --> 54:00.154
With the whole world against us.

54:01.447 --> 54:05.451
The family are the only ones
who accepted us.

54:06.285 --> 54:08.037
They gave us a home.

54:08.871 --> 54:10.581
This isn't a home, Lily.

54:11.999 --> 54:13.334
It's a fucking prison.

54:16.337 --> 54:17.755
Let's go make an announcement.

54:20.633 --> 54:24.637
If you still care for me, for us,

54:25.304 --> 54:28.808
I would think very seriously
about what you do next.

54:29.350 --> 54:32.186
This might be a prison,
but it's my prison.

54:38.192 --> 54:39.193
Watch him.

54:44.657 --> 54:45.741
You look better this way.

54:47.368 --> 54:48.369
[squeaks]

54:49.537 --> 54:52.873
[Lily] I apologize
for the late announcement.

54:52.957 --> 54:54.959
I hoped it wouldn't come to this,

54:55.042 --> 54:59.797
but our offering is on
the loose in the building.

55:00.631 --> 55:03.718
Her real name is Asia Reaves.

55:03.801 --> 55:06.804
I just dropped her picture
in the group chat.

55:06.929 --> 55:08.806
We disabled the elevators.

55:09.432 --> 55:14.353
Every tenant, every floor,
be on the lookout.

55:15.521 --> 55:17.815
We need her alive.

55:18.649 --> 55:21.068
But feel free to make her suffer.

55:21.944 --> 55:24.155
Asia, mark my words.

55:25.406 --> 55:29.410
I will personally sacrifice you...

55:30.536 --> 55:31.704
to our Lord.

55:40.171 --> 55:41.172
[moans softly]

55:55.311 --> 55:56.896
Picked another fight you can't win.

56:02.318 --> 56:03.569
I can't watch you die.

56:05.404 --> 56:07.615
Get to the elevator shaft.
I'll try to distract them.

56:09.617 --> 56:10.785
You can still make it.

56:11.327 --> 56:12.328
[Asia] Wait.

56:14.205 --> 56:15.623
[grunts]

56:17.083 --> 56:19.210
Really wish things had
turned out differently.

56:22.630 --> 56:24.632
[footsteps receding]

56:26.300 --> 56:27.301
[door closes]

56:29.428 --> 56:31.180
[woman squealing]

56:43.025 --> 56:44.360
[Asia] Maria!

57:07.800 --> 57:08.801
[Asia grunts]

57:10.052 --> 57:10.845
[yells]

57:13.639 --> 57:15.641
[ominous music playing]

57:23.274 --> 57:24.567
[panting]

57:24.692 --> 57:26.652
[both grunting]

57:30.698 --> 57:32.074
[both grunting]

57:35.119 --> 57:36.162
[Asia yelling]

57:41.458 --> 57:42.543
[eerie laughter]

57:47.673 --> 57:49.466
[growling, grunting]

57:54.847 --> 57:57.016
[grunts, panting]

57:59.727 --> 58:01.395
[eerie high-pitched laugh]

58:08.611 --> 58:10.613
[dramatic percussive music playing]

58:28.297 --> 58:30.049
[Maria's muffled grunting]

58:36.764 --> 58:37.765
Run!

58:38.766 --> 58:40.059
[screams]

58:40.643 --> 58:42.603
You fuckers!

58:43.229 --> 58:44.647
[yells]

58:44.772 --> 58:45.606
[assailant groans]

58:52.196 --> 58:53.405
[cries out, grunts]

58:59.370 --> 59:00.371
Maria!

59:00.496 --> 59:01.789
[dramatic music playing]

59:03.874 --> 59:05.209
[muffled cries]

59:11.632 --> 59:12.883
[yells]

59:12.967 --> 59:14.969
[rap music playing]

59:22.935 --> 59:24.520
[grunting]

59:44.456 --> 59:46.125
[grunts, pants]

59:48.294 --> 59:50.004
-[yells]
-[grunts]

59:58.721 --> 01:00:00.431
[yells]

01:00:07.604 --> 01:00:09.732
How many of you are there?

01:00:09.857 --> 01:00:10.858
[assailant yelling]

01:00:16.739 --> 01:00:18.032
[sizzling]

01:00:18.991 --> 01:00:19.867
[cries in agony]

01:00:28.625 --> 01:00:30.336
[both yelling]

01:00:44.099 --> 01:00:45.351
Give up!

01:00:45.934 --> 01:00:47.478
[dramatic musical sting]

01:00:49.104 --> 01:00:50.606
[rap music continues]

01:00:56.528 --> 01:00:58.030
[Asia yelling]

01:01:23.764 --> 01:01:25.015
[exhales]

01:01:29.686 --> 01:01:31.021
[grunts]

01:01:31.105 --> 01:01:33.273
No, no! Wait! Wait!

01:01:35.526 --> 01:01:38.779
Listen, I know you think
we're terrible people.

01:01:38.862 --> 01:01:41.949
But if you get to know us better,
we're actually really nice.

01:01:42.032 --> 01:01:43.325
We spared your sister.

01:01:43.409 --> 01:01:45.369
Look, this is my wife, Anne.

01:01:45.452 --> 01:01:46.829
She liked you.

01:01:46.954 --> 01:01:47.996
You remember her?

01:01:50.124 --> 01:01:51.291
[Asia pants]

01:01:52.376 --> 01:01:53.419
Maria?

01:02:08.392 --> 01:02:09.560
I missed you.

01:02:11.562 --> 01:02:12.729
I'm so sorry.

01:02:14.148 --> 01:02:16.608
I'm really sorry. I fucked up so badly.

01:02:16.733 --> 01:02:19.361
-I just... I...
-It's okay. It's okay.

01:02:19.445 --> 01:02:21.071
-I'm sorry.
-It's okay.

01:02:28.078 --> 01:02:29.163
You should have left me.

01:02:31.331 --> 01:02:32.624
Never.

01:02:32.749 --> 01:02:34.168
[water splashing]

01:02:37.296 --> 01:02:38.297
[man grunts]

01:02:40.340 --> 01:02:41.592
[Asia] We have to get out of here.

01:02:55.647 --> 01:02:56.940
[Lily sighs]

01:02:58.734 --> 01:02:59.776
[door shuts]

01:03:01.111 --> 01:03:02.112
[Lily exhales]

01:03:04.323 --> 01:03:05.741
[door opens]

01:03:05.824 --> 01:03:07.868
We checked upstairs. All clear.

01:03:07.951 --> 01:03:10.037
There's no way
she could have gotten past.

01:03:10.120 --> 01:03:11.079
Come on.

01:03:12.623 --> 01:03:14.124
[dramatic music playing]

01:03:20.088 --> 01:03:21.131
Go!

01:03:23.634 --> 01:03:26.386
I'm sorry, Lily. We tried our best.

01:03:28.138 --> 01:03:30.140
Search the floor.

01:03:31.683 --> 01:03:33.268
[Asia grunts] Ah, fuck.

01:03:34.269 --> 01:03:35.562
Let me see.

01:03:35.687 --> 01:03:36.688
It's fine.

01:03:36.813 --> 01:03:37.940
Let me see.

01:03:39.066 --> 01:03:40.067
Sit down.

01:03:45.364 --> 01:03:46.365
[Asia exhales]

01:03:47.449 --> 01:03:49.117
Where did you learn
how to fight like that?

01:03:50.160 --> 01:03:51.828
[inmates yelling, grunting]

01:03:53.747 --> 01:03:55.749
-Prison.
-Oh.

01:03:56.291 --> 01:03:57.459
Was it tough?

01:03:58.544 --> 01:03:59.711
Better than living with Dad.

01:04:05.008 --> 01:04:06.385
You know he died two years ago?

01:04:07.427 --> 01:04:08.637
No shit.

01:04:08.720 --> 01:04:09.763
No shit.

01:04:10.889 --> 01:04:11.974
Did you kill him?

01:04:13.308 --> 01:04:14.309
No.

01:04:15.602 --> 01:04:16.603
Cancer.

01:04:20.148 --> 01:04:22.025
Look, I shouldn't have
abandoned you back then.

01:04:22.776 --> 01:04:25.320
You needed me to protect you from Dad,
and I wasn't there.

01:04:26.613 --> 01:04:29.491
I swear there isn't a day in the last
ten years that I don't regret that.

01:04:31.451 --> 01:04:32.869
You can't fix the past.

01:04:34.037 --> 01:04:35.080
No.

01:04:36.081 --> 01:04:38.625
But I thought, if we don't
make it out of here tonight,

01:04:38.709 --> 01:04:39.918
I wanted you to know that.

01:04:42.296 --> 01:04:44.006
[male cultist] Send more people
to guard the entrance.

01:04:48.885 --> 01:04:50.887
[dramatic music playing]

01:05:13.827 --> 01:05:15.454
-[Maria] You good?
-Yeah.

01:05:15.537 --> 01:05:17.497
[Asia panting]

01:05:25.047 --> 01:05:26.423
-[grunts]
-[bullet ricochets]

01:05:33.221 --> 01:05:34.348
[gun clicking]

01:05:38.268 --> 01:05:40.020
-[Maria] Asia.
-Yes.

01:05:40.103 --> 01:05:41.813
[Maria] Come on! Shoot him!

01:05:43.523 --> 01:05:45.525
[air whooshing]

01:05:48.070 --> 01:05:49.071
[exhales]

01:05:50.113 --> 01:05:51.239
[grunts]

01:05:54.743 --> 01:05:55.744
[grunts]

01:05:58.705 --> 01:05:59.706
[yells]

01:06:06.171 --> 01:06:07.172
[Maria] Go!

01:06:09.132 --> 01:06:10.300
[grunts]

01:06:14.554 --> 01:06:16.390
Oh, my God! Oh, my God!

01:06:16.473 --> 01:06:17.474
[Maria yelling]

01:06:18.850 --> 01:06:19.976
[man yells]

01:06:27.734 --> 01:06:28.777
[Asia] Fuck!

01:06:28.860 --> 01:06:29.861
[grunts]

01:06:33.323 --> 01:06:34.324
[Lily] That's it.

01:06:35.701 --> 01:06:36.702
It's over.

01:06:36.785 --> 01:06:38.787
[suspenseful music playing]

01:06:42.582 --> 01:06:44.501
[thunder rumbling]

01:06:46.753 --> 01:06:47.796
No, it's not.

01:06:47.879 --> 01:06:49.131
You're ridiculous.

01:06:49.214 --> 01:06:51.049
[cultists laugh]

01:06:52.884 --> 01:06:54.761
You need me alive
for the sacrifice, don't you?

01:06:55.929 --> 01:06:57.097
Let Maria go,

01:06:57.180 --> 01:06:58.473
or I'll jump.

01:06:59.641 --> 01:07:02.185
-You can scrape up what's left.
-[Maria] Asia, no.

01:07:02.352 --> 01:07:03.603
So selfless.

01:07:04.479 --> 01:07:06.022
And so misguided.

01:07:07.357 --> 01:07:09.359
Do you even know whose life
you're fighting for?

01:07:10.193 --> 01:07:11.153
Lily, please.

01:07:11.236 --> 01:07:13.363
The fuck are you talking about?

01:07:14.531 --> 01:07:15.782
Didn't you ever think...

01:07:16.950 --> 01:07:19.745
How exactly did your dear sister

01:07:19.828 --> 01:07:23.081
come from being
just another one of our sacrifices

01:07:23.206 --> 01:07:26.752
to have a chance to join our family?

01:07:27.377 --> 01:07:30.505
What deal has she made?

01:07:37.095 --> 01:07:38.805
We'll take care of you.

01:07:39.431 --> 01:07:40.807
Do you understand?

01:07:41.933 --> 01:07:43.059
[Maria] Yes.

01:07:43.143 --> 01:07:44.394
Splendid.

01:07:45.228 --> 01:07:47.647
You will pledge to our Lord.

01:07:47.731 --> 01:07:52.152
When the time comes,
you will put your name on the list.

01:07:52.694 --> 01:07:55.530
Then you seal the deal with blood.

01:07:56.448 --> 01:07:58.116
You kill your sacrifice, dear.

01:07:59.993 --> 01:08:01.995
One death for one life.

01:08:02.120 --> 01:08:04.873
A small price for immortality.

01:08:05.707 --> 01:08:11.254
But if you break your word, run away,
or don't find an offering...

01:08:13.298 --> 01:08:15.050
our Lord will take you.

01:08:15.133 --> 01:08:16.760
[dramatic music playing]

01:08:19.763 --> 01:08:21.139
[Maria] I didn't want to hurt anyone.

01:08:22.974 --> 01:08:24.559
But there was no way out of this deal.

01:08:26.061 --> 01:08:27.854
I committed my soul to the Devil.

01:08:29.856 --> 01:08:31.525
Isabelle Davison,

01:08:31.608 --> 01:08:34.903
a woman from my last job,
was supposed to be my sacrifice.

01:08:36.780 --> 01:08:37.781
Oh, it's a small tradition.

01:08:37.864 --> 01:08:39.741
[Maria] But instead, you showed up.

01:08:39.866 --> 01:08:43.036
[Lily] One of our maids will be
rewarded tonight for her dedication.

01:08:43.161 --> 01:08:44.913
[Maria] And now, I'm out of time.

01:08:46.039 --> 01:08:47.332
[glasses clink]

01:08:47.415 --> 01:08:49.000
To Isabelle's memory.

01:08:49.084 --> 01:08:50.418
[all] To Isabelle.

01:08:50.502 --> 01:08:52.337
-Salud.
-Salud.

01:08:52.420 --> 01:08:54.089
[Maria] Without a sacrifice tonight...

01:08:55.757 --> 01:08:57.008
[swallows, exhales]

01:08:57.092 --> 01:08:58.218
...I'm dead.

01:09:09.187 --> 01:09:11.273
I feel sorry for you, Asia.

01:09:11.356 --> 01:09:12.482
Honestly.

01:09:13.191 --> 01:09:16.319
All this for nothing.

01:09:16.403 --> 01:09:17.487
Take them.

01:09:18.488 --> 01:09:19.990
-No. No, no, no.
-Come on. Move!

01:09:20.073 --> 01:09:22.367
No! No! No!

01:09:25.954 --> 01:09:27.956
[ethereal music playing]

01:09:40.135 --> 01:09:41.344
[Asia grunts]

01:09:49.811 --> 01:09:50.812
[snarls]

01:09:52.272 --> 01:09:53.815
[Asia whimpers]

01:09:59.362 --> 01:10:01.406
[winces, cries out]

01:10:02.574 --> 01:10:04.367
[groans in pain]

01:10:06.703 --> 01:10:08.955
Now we go see the head.

01:10:14.544 --> 01:10:17.088
If he asks, just play along.

01:10:18.006 --> 01:10:19.466
I hope he's in a good mood.

01:10:22.427 --> 01:10:24.429
[mysterious music playing]

01:10:41.613 --> 01:10:42.697
[Asia grunts]

01:10:49.162 --> 01:10:50.455
[grunts]

01:11:18.942 --> 01:11:20.819
[dramatic music playing]

01:11:26.658 --> 01:11:27.909
Pig on a stick?

01:11:28.743 --> 01:11:29.786
Really?

01:11:30.912 --> 01:11:33.164
Show some goddamn respect.

01:11:33.248 --> 01:11:34.499
[Asia winces]

01:11:46.970 --> 01:11:48.513
[low growl]

01:12:03.236 --> 01:12:04.529
[low grunt]

01:12:28.094 --> 01:12:29.095
[snorts]

01:12:30.472 --> 01:12:32.474
[grunts, snorts]

01:12:40.398 --> 01:12:42.317
[low growling]

01:12:47.572 --> 01:12:49.574
[The Head wheezes]

01:12:53.787 --> 01:12:55.747
[eerie howling]

01:12:56.873 --> 01:13:01.211
The unclean spirit entered the swine.

01:13:02.212 --> 01:13:04.923
[Lily] My Lord, we have
a new offering for you.

01:13:05.048 --> 01:13:06.257
Fuck me.

01:13:06.341 --> 01:13:09.010
We also brought you
Ray and Maria, my Lord.

01:13:09.761 --> 01:13:11.596
They both have betrayed us.

01:13:12.430 --> 01:13:14.140
[low growl]

01:13:14.224 --> 01:13:15.892
[snarls]

01:13:17.060 --> 01:13:19.020
It was a lapse in judgment, m'Lord.

01:13:19.938 --> 01:13:21.648
Ray felt sorry for the girl.

01:13:23.108 --> 01:13:25.026
Liar.

01:13:27.529 --> 01:13:30.657
Ray is out.

01:13:40.500 --> 01:13:42.210
[snarls]

01:13:43.628 --> 01:13:45.630
Kill him, Lily.

01:13:46.840 --> 01:13:48.091
Or die.

01:13:48.633 --> 01:13:51.427
[gasps] No, please. I beg of you.

01:13:54.264 --> 01:13:57.684
[bellows]

01:14:05.108 --> 01:14:06.818
No, no. No.

01:14:18.997 --> 01:14:20.540
I can't let you go.

01:14:22.000 --> 01:14:23.293
I made my choice.

01:14:25.837 --> 01:14:27.463
Now it's your turn, darling.

01:14:31.134 --> 01:14:32.594
[blade slashes]

01:14:32.719 --> 01:14:33.553
[Lily gasps]

01:14:34.387 --> 01:14:35.555
[The Head growls]

01:14:44.898 --> 01:14:45.899
[Kevin grunting]

01:14:50.445 --> 01:14:51.487
Now, girls.

01:14:51.613 --> 01:14:53.031
[blade clangs]

01:14:55.742 --> 01:14:57.160
[The Head] Maria...

01:14:58.077 --> 01:15:00.288
your time has come.

01:15:01.289 --> 01:15:03.291
I'm sorry, m'Lord.
I shouldn't have helped her.

01:15:04.042 --> 01:15:05.501
Please give me another chance.

01:15:06.753 --> 01:15:07.879
I'll do whatever it takes.

01:15:08.588 --> 01:15:09.589
What?

01:15:12.050 --> 01:15:15.011
[The Head growls]

01:15:16.763 --> 01:15:20.475
Then kill your sister.

01:15:21.184 --> 01:15:22.227
Maria.

01:15:23.019 --> 01:15:23.937
Please.

01:15:26.231 --> 01:15:27.232
I'm sorry.

01:15:27.941 --> 01:15:30.026
[dramatic music playing]

01:15:32.779 --> 01:15:34.822
[The Head] Write your name.

01:15:35.907 --> 01:15:37.492
Join us.

01:15:37.617 --> 01:15:39.035
Thank you, m'Lord.

01:15:41.371 --> 01:15:42.413
[The Head chuckles]

01:15:44.123 --> 01:15:45.500
[snorts, grunts]

01:15:48.920 --> 01:15:51.047
[grunts with pleasure]

01:16:01.099 --> 01:16:02.141
Now...

01:16:02.767 --> 01:16:05.061
seal the deal.

01:16:05.144 --> 01:16:06.062
[Asia's muffled grunts]

01:16:10.692 --> 01:16:12.568
I wish we had more time. [exhales]

01:16:17.115 --> 01:16:18.825
This is the only way.

01:16:20.743 --> 01:16:22.537
-[blade slashes]
-[grunts]

01:16:30.420 --> 01:16:32.422
[somber music playing]

01:16:58.740 --> 01:17:02.160
I'm so sorry.

01:17:19.761 --> 01:17:20.928
[The Head growls]

01:17:21.054 --> 01:17:22.055
Is she dead?

01:17:26.351 --> 01:17:27.643
Looks pretty dead to me.

01:17:27.727 --> 01:17:28.895
[Asia grunts]

01:17:31.356 --> 01:17:33.358
[suspenseful music playing]

01:17:45.328 --> 01:17:49.040
One death for one life.

01:17:55.505 --> 01:17:56.672
[Asia yelling]

01:18:10.978 --> 01:18:14.440
[Lily] Maria sacrificed herself
to make Asia immortal!

01:18:15.274 --> 01:18:16.859
Holy fuck.

01:18:17.402 --> 01:18:18.528
[Lily exhales]

01:18:21.280 --> 01:18:22.532
[The Head growls]

01:18:25.118 --> 01:18:27.453
Get the skin! Erase her name!

01:18:28.413 --> 01:18:29.288
[grunts]

01:18:36.838 --> 01:18:37.880
Dude.

01:18:38.714 --> 01:18:39.674
[growls]

01:18:39.757 --> 01:18:41.426
[heavy rock music playing]

01:18:48.474 --> 01:18:49.725
-[choking]
-[Asia grunts]

01:19:00.736 --> 01:19:02.280
[Asia yells, exhales]

01:19:03.322 --> 01:19:04.407
[grunts]

01:19:05.783 --> 01:19:07.326
[groans in agony]

01:19:07.910 --> 01:19:08.870
[Asia yells]

01:19:10.746 --> 01:19:12.748
[both grunting]

01:19:17.879 --> 01:19:18.880
[Asia yells]

01:19:25.887 --> 01:19:26.804
[Sharon gasps]

01:19:34.937 --> 01:19:36.063
[gasps]

01:19:37.398 --> 01:19:38.649
[The Head growls]

01:19:41.360 --> 01:19:42.904
[Lily and Asia grunting]

01:19:44.780 --> 01:19:46.365
-[Bob grunts]
-[Asia yelps]

01:19:54.832 --> 01:19:56.959
Ha! Help me, my Lord.

01:19:59.212 --> 01:20:01.130
-[steam hisses]
-[Bob grunts]

01:20:10.223 --> 01:20:11.224
[gasps]

01:20:14.977 --> 01:20:16.812
[choking]

01:20:19.649 --> 01:20:20.525
[exhales]

01:20:28.699 --> 01:20:29.825
[The Head grunting]

01:20:30.284 --> 01:20:31.410
[roars]

01:20:32.995 --> 01:20:34.539
[screeching]

01:20:42.713 --> 01:20:43.673
[screeches]

01:20:47.552 --> 01:20:48.553
[growls]

01:20:51.180 --> 01:20:52.557
[low growl]

01:20:54.684 --> 01:20:57.478
You want to play with swords?

01:20:57.603 --> 01:20:59.021
Let's play.

01:21:00.273 --> 01:21:01.315
[roaring]

01:21:02.984 --> 01:21:04.068
[yells]

01:21:19.166 --> 01:21:20.209
[Asia yells]

01:21:37.518 --> 01:21:39.061
[Asia yells]

01:21:54.201 --> 01:21:55.911
[both grunting]

01:22:02.543 --> 01:22:03.669
[Asia groans]

01:22:08.966 --> 01:22:10.343
[The Head as Maria] Hey, Butthead,

01:22:10.926 --> 01:22:12.345
you should have left me.

01:22:12.970 --> 01:22:14.680
I'd still be alive.

01:22:15.848 --> 01:22:17.975
I died because of you.

01:22:20.353 --> 01:22:21.395
Leave...

01:22:22.688 --> 01:22:24.565
my sister...

01:22:26.275 --> 01:22:27.276
alone.

01:22:27.360 --> 01:22:29.362
[intriguing music playing]

01:22:34.700 --> 01:22:35.660
[snarls]

01:22:42.249 --> 01:22:43.834
[yells]

01:22:46.170 --> 01:22:47.755
[screeches]

01:22:47.838 --> 01:22:49.298
[The Head squeals]

01:22:51.258 --> 01:22:52.426
[Lily screams]

01:22:55.179 --> 01:22:56.681
[scream echoes]

01:23:01.852 --> 01:23:03.562
[flesh squelching]

01:23:11.737 --> 01:23:12.905
[The Head snorts]

01:23:17.034 --> 01:23:18.160
[snorts]

01:23:18.285 --> 01:23:20.413
I want my sister back.

01:23:20.496 --> 01:23:22.623
Of course you do.

01:23:22.748 --> 01:23:24.417
You know the deal.

01:23:24.500 --> 01:23:26.794
One death for one life.

01:23:29.213 --> 01:23:31.215
I think we can do better than that.

01:23:32.633 --> 01:23:33.926
[howls]

01:23:36.512 --> 01:23:38.472
[grunts]

01:23:41.183 --> 01:23:42.768
[coughs, splutters]

01:23:43.728 --> 01:23:45.062
[cigarette lighter clicks]

01:23:45.187 --> 01:23:46.188
Shit.

01:23:47.523 --> 01:23:49.483
[roars in pain]

01:23:53.738 --> 01:23:55.364
[rap song playing]

01:23:58.367 --> 01:23:59.410
Just a flesh wound.

01:24:06.041 --> 01:24:07.668
[chokes]

01:24:09.253 --> 01:24:10.796
[grunts]

01:24:13.382 --> 01:24:14.550
Oh, no.

01:24:18.846 --> 01:24:20.347
[groans]

01:24:29.106 --> 01:24:31.275
I'll see you...

01:24:31.859 --> 01:24:33.652
in hell...

01:24:34.987 --> 01:24:36.864
Asia Reaves.

01:24:38.073 --> 01:24:39.533
[The Head screaming]

01:24:39.658 --> 01:24:41.535
I fucking hope so, bitch.

01:24:44.580 --> 01:24:45.998
[screams echo]

01:25:23.744 --> 01:25:26.747
If I were you, I'd clear out.

01:25:28.290 --> 01:25:30.292
[dramatic music playing]

01:25:38.884 --> 01:25:40.886
[dramatic music playing]

01:25:46.350 --> 01:25:49.645
[Asia grunts, pants]

01:25:49.770 --> 01:25:51.605
[alarm ringing]

01:25:59.780 --> 01:26:01.073
[grunts]

01:26:19.216 --> 01:26:20.384
What happened in there?

01:26:21.385 --> 01:26:22.261
Rich people.

01:26:25.764 --> 01:26:26.682
Hmm.

01:26:27.641 --> 01:26:28.684
[Asia exhales]

01:26:33.105 --> 01:26:34.064
[sighs]

01:26:38.277 --> 01:26:40.988
Hey, I'm... I'm...

01:26:41.113 --> 01:26:44.241
I'm just so sorry for your loss.

01:26:45.659 --> 01:26:47.119
I could take you wherever you...

01:26:48.579 --> 01:26:49.663
What is that?

01:26:54.293 --> 01:26:55.878
What the fuck is that?

01:26:56.003 --> 01:26:57.796
-[Maria gasps]
-Jesus Christ!

01:26:57.880 --> 01:26:59.840
[Maria hyperventilates]

01:27:02.676 --> 01:27:04.053
[exhales]

01:27:04.136 --> 01:27:05.095
Maria.

01:27:06.722 --> 01:27:08.015
-Asia.
-[private investigator] What the fuck?

01:27:11.727 --> 01:27:12.728
What happened?

01:27:13.187 --> 01:27:16.732
Well, that's a great question,
because you were just fuckin' dead!

01:27:17.274 --> 01:27:18.859
[The Head groaning]

01:27:19.860 --> 01:27:21.320
[Asia] I changed my name to yours.

01:27:22.154 --> 01:27:23.864
And I killed all those motherfuckers.

01:27:26.325 --> 01:27:28.744
What the hell are you two talking about?

01:27:31.330 --> 01:27:32.706
[giggles]

01:27:33.624 --> 01:27:34.625
I told you.

01:27:35.334 --> 01:27:37.419
I'm never gonna leave you again.

01:27:46.887 --> 01:27:47.888
[chuckles softly]

01:27:51.767 --> 01:27:52.768
You know what?

01:27:53.602 --> 01:27:54.603
I don't want to know.

01:27:55.187 --> 01:27:56.605
Fuck it.

01:27:57.189 --> 01:27:58.899
Fuck it! [chuckles]

01:28:04.238 --> 01:28:05.781
-[engine starts]
-Where we going?

01:28:06.490 --> 01:28:08.075
As far away from here as possible.

01:28:09.493 --> 01:28:11.328
I actually wouldn't mind some breakfast.

01:28:12.746 --> 01:28:14.748
[upbeat rock song playing]

01:28:43.110 --> 01:28:44.695
[grunting]

01:29:17.895 --> 01:29:20.189
-[blade slashing]
-[The Head grunting]

01:29:45.297 --> 01:29:46.465
[The Head screaming]

01:29:52.346 --> 01:29:54.473
[percussive music playing]

01:31:25.439 --> 01:31:27.441
[somber organ music playing]

01:31:51.048 --> 01:31:52.633
[music increases in tempo]

01:33:01.451 --> 01:33:03.453
[demonic voices singing]

01:34:14.107 --> 01:34:18.195
[evil laughter echoes]
